## Third-party notices

### Qwen mark

`src/mark.js` reproduces the geometric Qwen mark, taken from the official
`qwen-logo.svg` served by qwen.ai (icon portion, viewBox 0 0 20 20). Qwen is a
trademark of Alibaba Group. The MIT grant above covers this package's own code
and the Vietnamese translations; it does **not** grant any right to the Qwen
name or mark. If you redistribute or deploy this package publicly, confirm that
your use of the Qwen mark is permitted, or replace it with your own artwork:
the mark is three `<path>` elements in one array, so swapping it is a local
edit that touches nothing else.

### DSH English UI strings

`reference/en/` is not distributed. It is a verbatim copy of DeepSeek Harness's
own English interface text, regenerated on demand by
`node reference/extract.mjs` from a local DSH installation, and it is listed in
`.gitignore`. No DSH product text is republished by this repository.

### DSH itself

This package is a plugin for [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness)
and neither includes nor modifies DSH source. DSH is distributed under its own
license.
